rses (like **CS 179** or **IN4MATX 43**) would fit?  \n- Would you like to see the Fall 2026 schedule for CS122A (prereqs will be satisfied by then)?\n\n---\n\n**🔍 Data check:**\n- ❌ LLM mentioned EECS 114, but no such course exists in our data for Spring 2026.\n- ⚠️ COMPSCI 122A is in the flagged set (prereq unmet or scheduling conflict) but appears with recommendation language.\n- ⚠️ COMPSCI 122A is in the flagged set (prereq unmet or scheduling conflict) but appears with recommendation language.\n- ⚠️ COMPSCI 122A is in the flagged set (prereq unmet or scheduling conflict) but appears with recommendation language.\n- ⚠️ COMPSCI 122A is in the flagged set (prereq unmet or scheduling conflict) but appears with recommendation language.\n- ⚠️ COMPSCI 122A is in the flagged set (prereq unmet or scheduling conflict) but appears with recommendation language.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned I&C SCI 31, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned I&C SCI 33, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned COMPSCI 122B, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned COMPSCI 122C, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned I&C SCI 45C, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned I&C SCI 6B, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned I&C SCI 6D, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned COMPSCI 179, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set.\n- ℹ️ LLM mentioned IN4MATX 43, which exists in the catalog but was not in this turn's retrieval set."}
